The target enemy will be partially removed from the normal flow of time for [3, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] turns, inhibiting their ability to interact with the world. All damage taken will be reduced by [78%, 72%, 68%, 65%, 63% (TL1-5)], while all damage dealt will be reduced by [42%, 48%, 52%, 55%, 57% (TL1-5)].

While active, you form the frayed threads of their timeline into a temporal clone of them for the same duration, which assists you in combat. This clone is identical, but has [22%, 28%, 32%, 35%, 37% (TL1-5)] reduced life and deals [42%, 48%, 52%, 55%, 57% (TL1-5)] damage.
